OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged with assisting Russian
OL,4,Aintelligence service
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 31-year-old man has been charged
OL,7,Funder the National Security Act over
OL,8,Falleged contact with Russia's military
OL,9,Fintelligence agency.
OL,11,FJoshua Cammidge, from Swindon,
OL,12,Fallegedly received instructions from an
OL,13,Findividual believed to be linked to the
OL,14,FGRU Volunteer Corps, a group controlled
OL,15,Fby Russia's military intelligence
OL,16,Fagency, the Crown Prosecution service
OL,17,Fsaid.
OL,19,FHe has been charged with assisting a
OL,20,Fforeign intelligence service and
OL,21,Fpreparatory conduct.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
